0}^{\\pi }(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286665 1113 #uuid "0f1bdb56-1641-5eaa-b552-2869444ec6fa" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286665 1145 "We split the integral into the sum of two integrals and factor out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x){|}_{0}^{\\pi }+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =2[(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi )-(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡0)]+(\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\pi -\\operatorname{sin}⁡0) \\\\  & =2(1-(-1))+(0-0) \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286667 13194139534405 true] [17592186286666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286668 13194139534405 true] [17592186286666 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534405 true] [17592186286666 1041 "field-1" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286666 1104 #edb/ref 17592186286668 13194139534405 true] [17592186286666 1110 #uuid "ff369e19-2d53-5754-8604-da96cd1feba6" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286667 1034 "2" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286667 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534405 true] [17592186286667 1111 #uuid "bd1684aa-528f-5076-aafc-12890747170b" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286668 1034 "4" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286668 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534405 true] [17592186286668 1111 #uuid "d4fdfe07-65bf-5751-a7cb-0d5b2ebe8705" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286669 1017 #edb/ref 17592186286670 13194139534405 true] [17592186286669 1089 "q-73343" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286669 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534405 true] [17592186286669 1100 "${\\int }_{-1}^{7}({x}^{2}-{e}^{x})\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286669 1113 #uuid "f1dceaa8-c464-57ff-aad7-d905e8c07184" 13194139534405 true] [17592186286669 1145 "Splitt